nings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"ORA 2020 Q1","e":"ora","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Isaac Angel","x":"Importantly, our efforts to streamline operations and optimize power generation at the plant level continues to produce benefits, leading to margin expansion and increased profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/ormat-technologies-inc-ora-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"ORA 2020 Q1","e":"ora","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Isaac Angel","x":"We have not laid off or furloughed any employees due to the COVID-19 and continued to pay full salaries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/11/ormat-technologies-inc-ora-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"ORA 2020 Q2","e":"ora","d":"2020-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Strouse","x":"And then, again, I apologize if I missed this, but just the slightly reduced outlook for the electricity segment revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/ormat-technologies-inc-ora-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"ORA 2020 Q4","e":"ora","d":"2021-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Doron Blachar","x":"In Turkey, a new feed-in tariff was announced that although it is lower than the previous feeling tariff, we expect the market to adapt to it, and we anticipate new potential projects in Turkey in the coming months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/ormat-technologies-inc-ora-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ORA 2020 Q4","e":"ora","d":"2021-02-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Assi Ginzburg","x":"And if we do that, and if we receive it during 2021, we will increase the guidance similar to the way we've done it in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/ormat-technologies-inc-ora-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ORA 2021 Q2","e":"ora","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Julien Dumoulin Smith",